        "content": "# Module 14: NEGOTIATION AUR RELATIONSHIP MONEY SKILLS\n\nMODULE 14: NEGOTIATION AUR RELATIONSHIP MONEY SKILLS\n(ADVANCED LIFE SKILLS)\n\nBhai, ab tak tumne paisa kamana, bachana, invest karna, budget banana — sab seekha. Lekin ek cheez jo sabse zyada paisa bachati hai aur kamati hai, woh hai **negotiation** — aur doosri cheez jo sabse zyada paisa udata hai aur rishte kharab karti hai, woh hai **paise ki galat baat na karna**. Yeh module dono sikhayega. Yeh woh skills hain jo college mein koi nahi padhata, lekin life mein sabse zyada kaam aati hain. Whether it's your first salary, your rent, your freelance rate, or money talks with your partner — yeh module tumhe armed karega. Ready ho? Chalo shuru karte hain.\n\n---",
