        "title": "Negotiation Kya Hai — Paisa Bachane Ka Sabse Bada Haathiar (Part 3)",
        "content": "**Step 2: Dealer Comparison**\n\n| Dealer | On-Road Price |\n|--------|--------------|\n| Dealer A (Honda) | ₹94,000 |\n| Dealer B (Honda) | ₹90,500 |\n| Dealer C (Honda) | ₹88,500 |\n\n**Step 3: The Negotiation**\n\nKunal ne Dealer C ke saath negotiate kiya:\n\nKunal: \"Bhai, main cash mein khareedunga aur is mahine hi delivery chahiye. Aapke competitor ₹88,000 on-road de rahe hain with free accessories. Agar aap ₹87,000 mein deal kar dein with free helmet, toh aaj hi booking kar deta hoon.\"\n\nDealer: \"Sir, ₹87,000 bahut kam hai. ₹88,000 ho sakta hai with helmet.\"\n\nKunal: \"₹87,500 final — with helmet and first service free.\"\n\nDealer: (Socha — end of quarter hai, target poora karna hai) \"Done, ₹87,500 with helmet and free first service.\"\n\n**Savings Breakdown:**\n\n| Item | Original Price | Negotiated Price | Saved |\n|------|---------------|-----------------|-------|\n| On-road price | ₹94,000 | ₹87,500 | ₹6,500 |\n| Accessories | ₹4,000 | ₹2,000 | ₹2,000 |\n| Insurance (group discount) | — | — | ₹1,500 |\n| Free first service | ₹1,500 | ₹0 | ₹1,500 |\n| **Total Saved** | — | — | **₹13,500-₹15,000** |\n\n**Time Invested:** 2 weeks research + 3 dealer visits + 1 hour negotiation\n**Money Saved:** ₹15,000\n**Hourly Rate:** ₹15,000 / 23 hours = **₹652/hour**\n\nKya tumhe ₹652/hour milte hain kahi se? Yeh negotiation ka power hai!\n\n---",
