        "title": "Bill Negotiation — Monthly Expenses Kam Karo",
        "content": "### Types of Bills You Can Negotiate\n\n| Bill Type | Negotiable? | Typical Savings | Difficulty |\n|-----------|------------|-----------------|------------|\n| Internet/Broadband | Yes | ₹200-500/month | Easy |\n| Mobile Phone Plan | Yes | ₹100-300/month | Easy |\n| Cable/DTH | Yes | ₹100-200/month | Medium |\n| Electricity (commercial) | Sometimes | ₹500-2,000/month | Hard |\n| Gym Membership | Yes | ₹500-1,000/month | Medium |\n| Domestic Help | Yes | ₹200-500/month | Medium |\n\n### Scripts for Calling Customer Service\n\n#### Internet Bill Negotiation\n\n**You:** \"Hi, I've been a customer for [X months] and I'm paying ₹[current amount]. I've noticed [Competitor] is offering [better plan] at ₹[lower amount]. I'd like to continue, but I need a better deal.\"",
