        "title": "Joint Accounts vs Separate Accounts — Couple Ka Paisa System (Part 3)",
        "content": "**Couple 1: Amit & Priya — Fully Joint**\n- Both salaries go to joint account\n- All spending from joint account\n- **Works because:** Same values, complete trust\n\n**Couple 2: Kunal & Meera — Hybrid**\n- Joint account for rent, groceries, bills\n- Individual accounts for personal spending\n- **Works because:** Clear boundaries, shared goals\n\n**Couple 3: Sneha & Aman — Separate**\n- All accounts separate\n- Split 50-50 on shared expenses\n- **Works because:** Both value independence, similar incomes\n\n---",
