        "cardIndex": 3,
        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Family Financial Boundaries — Maa-Baap Aur Paisa (Part 3)",
        "content": "### Real Example: Sneha Balanced Sending Money Home with Her Own Savings\n\n**Background:** Sneha, 25, ₹45,000 take-home. Parents in Jaipur (father retired).\n\n**Family Expectations:** ₹12,000/month\n**Sneha's Available:** ₹7,000 (max)\n\n**The Conversation:**\n> \"Mummy, main ₹7,000 bhej sakti hoon regularly. ₹12,000 mere budget se bahar hai. Lekin:\n> 1. ₹7,000 har mahine fixed\n> 2. ₹2,000 extra har doosre mahine\n> 3. Festivals pe ₹10,000-15,000 ek saath\n>\n> Isse aapka ₹7,000-8,000/month ho jaayega average.\"\n\n**Result:** Sneha ne balance banaya — family ko support bhi mila, apni savings bhi hui.\n\n---",
