        "content": "1. **Negotiation is a life skill** — har roz use hota hai, sirf business mein nahi\n2. **Salary negotiation** se lifetime earnings mein ₹60-90 Lakh ka fark pad sakta hai\n3. **Research is power** — bina data ke negotiation emotional demand hai\n4. **BATNA rakho** — hamesha apna best alternative ready rakho\n5. **Win-win mindset** se relationships bhi bachti hain aur paisa bhi\n6. **Money conversations** relationships mein zaroori hain — awkward ho sakti hain, lekin necessary hain\n7. **Marriage se pehle** paise ki baat karna — best investment hai future ke liye\n8. **Joint vs separate accounts** — koi right answer nahi hai, jo tumhare liye work kare woh choose karo\n9. **Family boundaries** set karna guilt se nahi, clarity se hota hai\n10. **Conflict resolution** — heated mein mat bolo, \"I feel\" statements use karo, goals pe focus karo\n\n### Final Motivational Message\n\nYaar, yeh module padhke tumhe lag raha hoga ki bahut kuch seekhna baaki hai. Aur sach mein hai! Lekin yaad rakhna — **har expert ek time pe beginner tha.**\n\nNegotiation seekhne ka sabse accha tarika hai **practice karna**. Chhote-chhote situations mein shuru karo:\n- Auto-rider se meter pe chalne ke liye bolo\n- Online shopping mein coupon dhundho\n- Dost ke saath bill split karo proportionally\n- Manager se WFH discuss karo\n\nHar negotiation tumhe better banati hai. Aur relationships mein — **communication is everything**. Paise ki baat karna awkward lagta hai, lekin jab tak baat nahi karoge, problems solve nahi hongi.",
